  "context_markdown": "This register lists **12 known, intentional divergences** between the supplied source and the current working edition. These are choices adopted for this edition; they do not assert the original transcriber's intentions.\n\nThe source is the 40-page Breitkopf & Härtel collected edition, plate B.49, printed pages 79–118, supplied in the IMSLP04767 Dover PDF. It contains all six movements with the later **2/4 Allegro finale**, not the Große Fuge. The source is an edition, not an autograph or a complete critical-source collation.\n\nAll 40 source pages were compared at page/system level with all 48 pages of the native transcription. Magnified details and native XML resolved selected questions. This is not an independent second transcription or a guarantee that every small mark is correct. The table uses movement-local printed numbers; upbeats, alternate endings and split bars have additional physical XML objects.",
